{"id":"e369e02605242bf1","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-internal-negation.md","title":"内部否定","display":"df-internal-negation — 内部否定","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-internal-negation","aliases":["91-df-internal-negation","91-df-inner-negation"],"display":"df-internal-negation — 内部否定","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-internal-negation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-internal-negation</span><span>91-df-inner-negation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-internal-negation — 内部否定"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-internal-negation-—-内部否定-$T(\\neg)$\">df-internal-negation — 内部否定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\neg)\">\\(T(\\neg)\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的对象语言)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}negation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}(\\varphi)\n\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\qquad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}negation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}(\\varphi)\n\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\qquad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}\\)</span> : 内部否定（internal negation）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner)\\)</span> : &quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>的否定是真的&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>内部否定的含义：\n内部否定将否定符号放在真理谓词的&quot;内部&quot;，断言否定句子是真的。</p>\n<p>内部否定 vs 外部否定：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>写法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>内部否定</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n<td>&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>的否定是真的&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部否定</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\">\\(\\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\\)</span></td>\n<td>&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>不真&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>在固定点信息集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 中，内部否定为真恰指\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。它表达“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 被判假”，\n而不只是“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 尚未被判真”。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 是间隙句，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span> 也取未定义值。</p>\n<p>KF 在经典背景逻辑中陈述内部真理公理，但不把这个内部否定一般地等同于\n经典外部式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-internal-negation-—-内部否定-$T(\\neg)$","text":"df-internal-negation — 内部否定 $T(\\neg)$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T(\\neg)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}negation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}(\\varphi)\n\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\qquad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)","display":false}],"bytes":1580,"backlinks":[{"id":"f28d9b3f22314622","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\mathrm{in}}$ (内部否定谓词, see [[